  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3004.01 Certification of ERCs",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3004.01 Certification of ERCs. The department shall certify ERCs upon verification by the department that the emissions reductions are real, surplus, quantifiable, enforceable, and permanent, and that the Generator source is not in violation of any emissions limitation of a permit issued by the division or EPA, any consent agreement or any court order, or any NAAQS, except for ground level ozone, or AAL.\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a3000.html"
}
